        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “does not comply with” dengan perkataan “contravenes”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_4__para_b__subpara_ii",
