        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_4__para_c__subpara_iii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (4)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_4__para_c__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_4__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong perkataan “or” yang terdapat di hujung perenggan (a);"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_4__para_c__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_4__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (b), dengan menggantikan koma dengan perkataan “; or”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_4__para_c__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_4__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (b) perenggan yang berikut: “(c) delivers or causes to be delivered a hire- purchase agreement in contravention of subsection (2A),”. Seksyen baru 4E, 4F dan 4G"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 4D seksyen yang berikut: “Motor vehicle registration certificate 4E. (1) Where the goods comprised in a hire-purchase agreement is a motor vehicle, a hirer may make a request in writing to an owner to keep the registration certificate of the motor vehicle. (2) The owner shall, upon the request of the hirer under subsection (1), furnish the registration certificate of the motor vehicle to the hirer. (3) For the purpose of subsection (1), registration certificate includes registration book. (4) An owner who contravenes subsection (1) shall be guilty of an offence under this Act. Altered or modified motor vehicle 4F. (1) A hire-purchase agreement shall not be entered into where the goods comprised in the hire-purchase agreement is a motor vehicle which has been altered or modified in its construction and structure. (2) A hire-purchase agreement that contravenes subsection (1) shall be void. Declaration on second-hand motor vehicle 4G. (1) Where goods to be comprised in a hire-purchase agreement is a second-hand motor vehicle, the person who intends to enter into the hire-purchase agreement in respect of such second-hand motor vehicle shall declare in writing any defects of the second-hand motor vehicle in accordance with the inspection report by the relevant authority determined by the Controller. (2) For the purpose of subsection (1), “defect” includes defect to the mechanical or operational system, construction, structure and build-up and fitting of the motor vehicle. (3) Any person who contravenes this section shall be guilty of an offence under this Act.”. Pindaan seksyen 5"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_6__para_a",
