        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_6__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_6__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 5 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_6__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (1), dengan menggantikan perkataan “fourteen” dengan perkataan “twenty-one”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_6__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong subseksyen (1A);"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_6__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (2), dengan menggantikan perkataan “fourteen” dengan perkataan “twenty-one”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_6__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (3) subseksyen yang berikut: “(4) Any person who contravenes this section shall be guilty of an offence under this Act.”. Pindaan seksyen 16"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_7__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_7__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_7__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 16 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_7__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (1) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(1) Subject to this section, an owner shall not exercise any power of taking possession of goods comprised in a hire-purchase agreement arising out of any breach of the agreement relating to the payment of instalments unless the payment of instalments amounts to not more than one third of the total cash price of the goods comprised in the hire-purchase agreement and there had been two successive defaults of payment by the hirer and he has served on the hirer a notice, in writing, in the form set out in the Fourth Schedule and the period fixed by the notice has expired, which shall not be less than twenty-one days after the service of the notice.”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_7__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) subseksyen yang berikut: “(1A) Notwithstanding subsection (1), if the payment of instalments made amounts to more than one third of the total cash price of the goods comprised in a hire-purchase agreement and there had been two successive defaults of payment by the hirer, an owner shall not exercise any power of taking possession of the goods comprised in the hire-purchase agreement arising out of any breach of the agreement relating to the payment of instalments unless he has obtained an order of the court to that effect. (1B) Where an owner has obtained an order of the court under subsection (1A) and he has served on the hirer a notice, in writing, in the form set out in the Fourth Schedule and the period fixed by the notice has expired, which shall not be less than twenty-one days after the service of the notice, the owner may exercise the power of taking possession of goods referred to in subsection (1A).”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_7__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menomborkan semula subseksyen (1A) yang sedia ada sebagai subseksyen (1C). Seksyen baru 17A dan 17B"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 17 seksyen yang berikut: “Permits for repossession 17A. (1) No person shall undertake repossession of goods comprised in a hire-purchase agreement without a written permit issued by the Controller. (2) Any person who contravenes subsection (1) shall be guilty of an offence under this Act. Offence to appoint non-permit holder 17B. (1) An owner shall appoint as his agent to undertake the repossession of goods comprised in a hire-purchase agreement a person who is a permit holder under subsection 17A(1). (2) An owner who contravenes subsection (1) shall be guilty of an offence under this Act.”. Seksyen baru 30A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@/~cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/18/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 30 seksyen yang berikut: “Booking fee 30A. (1) No owner, dealer, agent or person acting on behalf of the owner shall collect or accept a booking fee from an intending hirer before the receipt of the duly completed form set out in Part II of the Second Schedule by the hirer. (2) The booking fee referred to in subsection (1) shall not exceed one percent of the cash price of the goods comprised in a hire-purchase agreement. (3) Notwithstanding anything under this Act, the booking fee shall form part of the deposit under section 31. (4) An owner, dealer, agent or person acting on behalf of the owner shall refund ninety percent of the booking fee to the intending hirer upon the withdrawal of the booking of the goods comprised in a hire-purchase agreement. (5) Any person who contravenes this section shall be guilty of an offence under this Act.”. Pindaan seksyen 31"
      }
    }
  ]
}
